{"created": "2026-08-23T20:26:45.906769+00:00", "modified": "2026-08-23T20:26:46.912418+00:00", "id": 19574983, "conceptrecid": "19574982", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19574983", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.19574982", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19574983", "metadata": {"title": "Dataset for Iterative and data-driven ortholog mining enables reliable discovery of stereoselective ketoreductases", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19574983", "publication_date": "2026-07-01", "description": "<p>The Zenodo repository contains the complete experimental datasets underlying all main-text and Supporting Information figures and tables of the manuscript, including raw and processed GC-FID and chiral HPLC-UV peak data (retention times, peak areas), external calibration curves, calculated conversions (with means and standard deviations), and nanoDSF-derived melting temperatures for ketoreductase (KRED) ortholog variants. Data cover two iterative rounds of ortholog mining - an initial broad sampling of 48 evolutionarily distant variants and a refined sampling of 60 phylogenetically closer orthologs - alongside substrate-scope studies on five pharmaceutically relevant prochiral ketones (1a&ndash;5a).</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Stockinger, Peter", "affiliation": "University of Bern", "orcid": "0000-0002-3494-7302"}, {"name": "Niklaus, Michael", "affiliation": "ZHAW Zurich University of Applied Sciences", "orcid": "0000-0003-4713-261X"}, {"name": "Yar, Kevin", "affiliation": "ZHAW Zurich University of Applied Sciences"}, {"name": "Imstepf, Nicolas", "affiliation": "ZHAW Zurich University of Applied Sciences"}, {"name": "Pastierikova, Ivana", "affiliation": "ZHAW Zurich University of Applied Sciences"}, {"name": "K\u00fcng, Jasmin", "affiliation": "ZHAW Zurich University of Applied Sciences"}, {"name": "Hanlon, Steven Paul", "affiliation": "Roche"}, {"name": "Iding, Hans", "affiliation": "Roche"}, {"name": "Honda Malca, Sumire", "affiliation": "ZHAW Zurich U